## API REST Helper (`api_helper.prg`)
Funciones utilitarias ya creadas:
- `ApiCall(lcUrl, lcMethod, lcBody)` — HTTP genérico con `MSXML2.XMLHTTP`
- `ApiSuccess(lcResp)` — Verifica `"success":true`
- `JsonArrayToCursor(lcJson, lcCursor)` — Parsea array JSON a cursor VFP (campos C(254))
- `JsonVal()`, `JsonDate()`, `JsonBool()`, `JsonStr()` — Conversores JSON→VFP

